# ============================================================
#  Implicit solvation (SMD) single point
#  For a solvation free energy: run this and a gas-phase job
#  at the same level, then dG_solv = G(soln) - G(gas).
#  Change SMDSolvent: water / methanol / acetonitrile / dmso / ...
#  Verified runnable on ORCA 6.1.1.
# ============================================================
! B3LYP D4 def2-TZVP RIJCOSX def2/J CPCM(water) TightSCF

%cpcm
   SMD        true
   SMDSolvent "water"
end

%maxcore 3000

* xyzfile 0 1 mol.xyz
